[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u79C1\u306E\u5E2B\u5320\u3001\u30E4\u30B9\u30DF\u30FC\u30F3\u306F\u5049\u5927\u306A\u5192\u967A\u8005\u3068\u3057\u3066\n\u3000\u77E5\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(My master, Yasmine, was known as a great adventurer.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u6570\u3005\u306E\u90AA\u60AA\u306A\u9B54\u7269\u3092\u5012\u3057\u3001\u4EBA\u3005\u3092\u6551\u3063\u305F\u82F1\u96C4\u3060\u3002\n\u3000\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u4EBA\u3068\u306A\u308A\u3092\u77E5\u308B\u8005\u306F\u5C11\u306A\u3044\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(A hero who defeated countless evil monsters and saved many lives. However, few knew her true nature.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u7A81\u7136\u3084\u3063\u3066\u304D\u3066\u306F\u9B54\u7269\u3092\u5012\u3057\u3001\u3059\u3050\u306B\u5225\u306E\u5730\u3078\u3068\n\u3000\u65C5\u7ACB\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3046\u306E\u3060\u3068\u3044\u3046\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(They say she would appear suddenly to slay monsters, then depart just as quickly for another land.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u306E\u7406\u7531\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3001\u5F7C\u5973\u306F\u9B54\u7269\u3078\u306E\u5FA9\u8B90\u5FC3\u304C\n\u3000\u305D\u3046\u3055\u305B\u305F\u3068\u5BC2\u3057\u305D\u3046\u306B\u8A9E\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(When asked why, she spoke with a lonesome look about how her desire for revenge against monsters drove her onward.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u9B54\u7269\u3092\u5012\u3059\u307E\u3067\u4F11\u3080\u6687\u306F\u306A\u3044\u306E\u3060\u3068\u3002\n\u3000\u305D\u3093\u306A\u7D42\u308F\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306E\u306A\u3044\u65C5\u306E\u4E2D\u3067\u3001\u5F7C\u5973\u306F\u5E74\u8001\u3044\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She said she couldn\u0027t rest until every monster was slain. She grew old on that endless journey.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6700\u5F8C\u306F\u96A0\u5C45\u751F\u6D3B\u3092\u9001\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3068\u805E\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3002\n\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u5F7C\u5973\u3068\u51FA\u4F1A\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard she spent her final days in retirement.\nHow did you come to meet her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7ADC\u3078\u306E\u5FA9\u8B90\u3092\u8A93\u3063\u3066\u7ADC\u3092\u8FFD\u3044\u304B\u3051\u3066\n\u3044\u305F\u3089\u540C\u3058\u3088\u3046\u306B\u8ABF\u3079\u308B\u8005\u304C\u3044\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While pursuing a dragon I had sworn vengeance against,\nI encountered another person investigating it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u304C\u30E4\u30B9\u30DF\u30FC\u30F3\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3063\u3066\u308F\u3051\u304B\u3002\n\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u5076\u7136\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u306A\u2026\u2026\u3044\u3084\u3001\u904B\u547D\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that was Yasmine, huh?\nQuite the coincidence... or perhaps fate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F7C\u5973\u306B\u983C\u307F\u8FBC\u307F\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u7ADC\u3092\u5012\u3059\u8853\u3092\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3068\u3002\n\u521D\u3081\u306E\u3046\u3061\u306F\u65AD\u3089\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I begged her to teach me how to slay dragons.\nAt first she refused, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u5EA6\u3082\u8A2A\u306D\u3001\u72EC\u5B66\u3067\u4FEE\u884C\u3057\u3066\u5F97\u305F\u6280\u3092\u898B\u305B\u3066\u3044\u304F\u3046\u3061\u306B\n\u8A8D\u3081\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u3002\uFF15\u5E74\u5F7C\u5973\u306B\u5E2B\u4E8B\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I kept visiting her, showing her the techniques I\u0027d learned through self-training.\nEventually she accepted me. I studied under her for five years."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3057\u3066\u3001\u5F7C\u5973\u306F\u5DF1\u304C\u77E5\u308B\u3059\u3079\u3066\u3092\n\u79C1\u306B\u6388\u3051\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And so, she passed on to me everything she knew."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3078\u3048\u3002\u4ED8\u304D\u5408\u3044\u3065\u3089\u3044\u4EBA\u304B\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3093\u3060\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3044\u4EBA\u3058\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? I thought she\u0027d be difficult to get along with,\nbut she sounds like a good person after all!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3042\u3042\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u3002\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u512A\u3057\u3044\u4EBA\u3060\u3063\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes, she was. She was truly kind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u3042\u3001\u305D\u306E\u30E4\u30B9\u30DF\u30FC\u30F3\u306E\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3069\u3046\u6B4C\u308F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\u3002\n\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306E\u6B4C\u306B\u8033\u3092\u50BE\u3051\u3066\u307F\u3088\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, let\u0027s hear how Yasmine\u0027s tale is told.\nLet us listen to Diona\u0027s song."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\u5E2B\u5320\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3001\u8A71\u3057\u3066\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u304C\n\u3000\u4E00\u3064\u3060\u3051\u3042\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(There is... one thing about Master that I haven\u0027t told anyone.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u308C\u306F\u3001\u5E2B\u5320\u306F\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u65C5\u3092\u5F8C\u6094\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3002\n\u3000\u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u6B7B\u306E\u9593\u969B\u3001\u6795\u3082\u3068\u3067\u79C1\u306F\u305D\u306E\u8A00\u8449\u3092\u805E\u3044\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That she regretted her journey. I heard these words\nby her bedside in her final moments.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3002\u304A\u524D\u306F\u7ADC\u304C\u618E\u304F\u3066\u618E\u304F\u3066\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304C\u306A\u3044\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304C\u3001\n\u5FA9\u8B90\u3060\u3051\u306E\u65E5\u3005\u306F\u306D\u3002\u4F55\u3082\u6B8B\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna. I know you hate dragons with every fiber of your being,\nbut a life lived only for revenge... leaves you with nothing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E4\u30B9\u30DF\u30FC\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yasmine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF12\u5E74\u3060\u3002\uFF12\u5E74\u65C5\u3092\u3057\u306A\u3055\u3044\u3002\u8272\u3093\u306A\u571F\u5730\u3067\u3001\n\u8272\u3093\u306A\u4EBA\u3092\u898B\u3066\u3001\u81EA\u5206\u3068\u5411\u304D\u5408\u3044\u306A\u3055\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Two years. Travel for two years. Visit different lands,\nmeet different people, and face yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E4\u30B9\u30DF\u30FC\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yasmine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u524D\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u4F55\u304C\u5927\u5207\u306A\u306E\u304B\u3001\u624B\u653E\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3044\u3051\u306A\u3044\n\u3082\u306E\u304C\u306A\u3093\u306A\u306E\u304B\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3092\u77E5\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To learn what truly matters to you,\nwhat you must never let go of."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E4\u30B9\u30DF\u30FC\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yasmine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u524D\u306B\u306F\u306D\u3002\u79C1\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u307B\u3057\u304F\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don\u0027t want you... to end up like me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E4\u30B9\u30DF\u30FC\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yasmine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5E2B\u5320\u306E\u907A\u8A00\u306B\u5F93\u3044\u3001\u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u4EA1\u304D\u5F8C\u3001\u79C1\u306F\uFF12\u5E74\u304B\u3051\u3066\n\u3000\u56FD\u4E2D\u3092\u307E\u308F\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Following Master\u0027s last wishes, after her passing,\nI spent two years traveling across the country.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u308C\u306F\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u79C1\u306E\u5FA9\u8B90\u306E\u610F\u7FA9\u3092\n\u3000\u898B\u3064\u3081\u76F4\u3059\u6642\u9593\u3068\u306A\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That time truly gave me a chance to reexamine\nthe meaning of my revenge.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5E2B\u5320\u306E\u8A00\u8449\u304C\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u3001\u4ECA\u3082\u5FA9\u8B90\u306B\u56DA\u308F\u308C\u305F\n\u3000\u307E\u307E\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3060\u308D\u3046\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Without Master\u0027s words, I would likely still be\nchained to my vengeful path.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306F\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u65C5\u3092\u5F8C\u6094\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u304C\u3001\n\u3000\u5C11\u306A\u304F\u3068\u3082\u79C1\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u6551\u308F\u308C\u305F\u3002\u3060\u304B\u3089\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Though you regretted your own journey,\nat least know that you saved me. So...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u82F1\u96C4\u306F\u6C7A\u610F\u3059\u308B\u3002\u4EA1\u304D\u5E2B\u306E\u6280\u3068\u5FD7\u306E\u7D99\u627F\u3092\u3002\n\u5F7C\u5973\u304C\u751F\u304D\u305F\u8A3C\u3092\u523B\u3080\u305F\u3081",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The hero vows to carry on her late master\u0027s techniques and will.\nTo engrave the proof that she lived."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F7C\u5973\u306E\u9B42\u306F\u3044\u307E\u3060\u3001\u82F1\u96C4\u3068\u5171\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Her spirit lives on, forever with the hero."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u65C5\u3092\u3001\u7121\u99C4\u306B\u306A\u3069\u3055\u305B\u306A\u3044\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I won\u0027t let your journey be in vain.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]